{"articleNo":"380252","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=380252&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 22-2차 재활용환경성평가 전문인력 양성과정 교육 참여 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.06.27","hit":"5910","attachments":[{"name":"22-2차 재활용환경성평가 전문인력 양성과정 교육생 모집 안내문.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=380252&attachNo=113625"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmwehA2CGsAyAtADgMRQIQCIDMBWuAErgOoCeSA9lQDYAaAdCgHYDmQA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 13px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: Dotum; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); border: 0px; line-height: 14.4px;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">2022년 2차 재활용환경성평가 전문인력 양성과정 교육생 모집 안내</span></span></strong><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: 24px; font-family: Dotum; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: 24px; font-family: Dotum; text-align: center;\"><br><strong style=\"font-family: NanumBold; border: 0px; background: transparent; line-height: 14.4px;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">1. 교육목적</span></strong></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: 24px; font-family: Dotum; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 16px;\"><b><br></b></span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">O 재활용관리제도 선진화 및 재활용환경성평가 도입에 따라 폐기물 재활용&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: 24px; font-family: Dotum; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">환경성 평가를&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">수행하기 위한 전문인력양성</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: 24px; font-family: Dotum; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: 24px; font-family: Dotum; text-align: center;\"><strong style=\"font-family: NanumBold; border: 0px; background: transparent; line-height: 14.4px;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">2. 교육개요</span></strong></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: 24px; font-family: Dotum; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 16px;\"><b><br></b></span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">O (교육기간) 7.25(월) ~ 8.4(목), 2주</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; ※ 수료평가 8.12(금)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: 24px; font-family: Dotum; text-align: center;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; border: 0px;\">O (교육방식) 비대면(온라인) 및 오프라인 병행</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: 1.8; font-family: Dotum; text-align: center;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; border: 0px;\">&nbsp; ※ 오프라인 교육장소 : 한국환경산업기술원(서울 은평구), 국립환경과학원(인천 서구)</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; border: 0px;\">O (교육내용) 재활용개론 등 이론 3개 과정, 평가실무 등 심화·실습 2개 과정</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; border: 0px;\">O (수료기준) 교육시간의 80%이상 출석 및 수료평가 60점 이상 합격자</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; border: 0px;\">O (교육 우수 수료생 혜택) 한국환경산업기술원장 표창 수여</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: 24px; font-family: Dotum; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: 24px; font-family: Dotum; text-align: center;\"><strong style=\"font-family: NanumBold; border: 0px; background: transparent; line-height: 14.4px;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">3. 교육대상</span></strong></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: 1.8; font-family: Dotum; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 16px;\"><b><br></b></span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">O (선발인원) 20명</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; ※ 선발대상자는 이메일과 문자로 개별 통보</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">O (자격요건) 환경분야 산업기사 이상 또는 현장실무경력 1년 이상인 자</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; ※ 우대사항 : 환경관련 측정분석기관 재직 중이거나, 근무경력자 우선 선발</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: 1.8; font-family: Dotum; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: 24px; font-family: Dotum; text-align: center;\"><strong style=\"font-family: NanumBold; border: 0px; background: transparent; line-height: 14.4px;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">4. 교육신청 및 제출서류</span></strong></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: 1.8; font-family: Dotum; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 16px;\"><b><br></b></span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">O (신청기간) 6.17(금) ~ 7.15(금)</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">O (교 육 비) 무 료</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">O (신청방법) 온라인 접수(</span><a href=\"http://www.eduet.or.kr/\" style=\"border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); line-height: 14.4px; cursor: pointer;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">www.eduet.or.kr</span></a><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">O (제출서류) 신청서, 학력증명서, 경력(재직)증명서, 자격증 사본 등 첨부파일 업로드</span><br><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">O (문의처) 한국환경산업기술원 기업육성실(02-2284-1718, 02-2284-1719)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: 24px; font-family: Dotum; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: 24px; font-family: Dotum; text-align: center;\"><strong style=\"font-family: NanumBold; border: 0px; background: transparent; line-height: 14.4px;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 14pt;\">5. 기타사항</span></strong></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: 1.8; font-family: Dotum; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 16px;\"><b><br></b></span><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">O 지원자는 신청기간, 자격요건 등의 내용을 확인하여 기한 내 신청하여 주시고, 신청서 기재사항 착오,&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: 1.8; font-family: Dotum; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">누락&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">또는 연락불능으로 인한 불이익을 받지 않도록 유의하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: 1.8; font-family: Dotum; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; font-size: 12pt;\">O 제출된 서류는 신청서 및 응시자격 확인을 위해 활용하며, 교육생 선정 여부와 관계없이 반환하지 않습니다.</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); font-family: 나눔고딕, &quot;나눔 고딕&quot;, Nanum, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 13px; text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Dotum; font-size: 12pt;\">O 정부의 코로나바이러스감염증-19 예방 지침을 참고하여 교육 및 수료평가를 운영할 예정이므로&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; border: 0px; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); font-family: 나눔고딕, &quot;나눔 고딕&quot;, Nanum, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 13px; text-align: center; line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Dotum; font-size: 12pt;\">향후 안내 사항을 숙지하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
